{"reviewId": "254854030_87TiccIOt", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 13, "content": "每一轮康波周期的衰退阶段必须经历两次冲击才能彻底完成康波从衰退走向萧条的切换，这是历史上每一轮康波都反复出现的规律。第一次危机通常发生在康波繁荣结束、衰退刚开始的时候，一般是由资产泡沫破裂、流动性收紧引发的局部性危机，主要作用是刺破前期的繁荣泡沫，让经济进入收敛状态。第二次危机则是康波衰退的终极冲击，发生在收敛假象被打破、经济向下突破的阶段，它往往由全球周期共振回落、强势美元、资源国崩溃、债务出清共同引发，是一次更彻底更全面的出清。只有经历这第二次危机的冲击，康波衰退才算真正完成，全球资产价格才会跌出真正的底部，后面的大机会才会到来。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "abstract": "康波衰退向来以两次危机来完成", "range": "4423-4437", "chapterName": "08 康波衰退二次冲击正在靠近", "chapterIdx": 13, "reviewId": "254854030_87TiccIOt", "userVid": 254854030, "topics": [], "createTime": 1774512831, "userEditTime": 1776599253, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "08 康波衰退二次冲击正在靠近", "author": {"userVid": 254854030, "name": "薄荷白桃乌龙茶", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/DYAIOgq83eotCrwSFSicibG99Nkf5vrg0ff5gIBNXvxUEHLjQOgqCkgge06Nib9Vp2791QZZJPKUpm1JVpXRn1RoA/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20240826-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 23, "likes": [{"userVid": 211979211, "name": "蜡妹小欣", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/78EkX665csCnhF3ic21HRJFL2EIdUPG3xnKSoDSOFq5dmrETnQFpIK5e841j3n64vF2I2JlwUEKs/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-365", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 365}}], "commentsCount": 1, "